Here is a complete, single-file HTML application. It includes a responsive layout, a dynamic parsing engine that turns a messy text list into structured data, a visual dashboard summary, and a print-ready CSS layout that generates clean, individual box labels.

Save the code below as an `.html` file (e.g., `box_labeler.html`) and open it in any web browser.

